  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EBRD Crisis Response Special Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norwegian funds will be used as grants blended into a larger EBRD-funded financing package to support Moldova strengthen energy security by sourcing gas from non-Russian sources. The funds will flow through EBRD&apos;s Crisis Special Response Fund which has donor-specific windows for support to Ukraine and neighbouring and affected countries such as Moldova.</narrative>
  </description>
